2026-09-12 10:29:37.007 GMT [42] STATEMENT:  SELECT
	    views.viewname AS view_name,
	    views.definition AS view_sql,
	    views.schemaname AS namespace,
	    obj_description(class.oid, 'pg_class') AS description
